G26: compile the port-owned streaming download store and bounded PNG/JPEG
content handlers. The Ciuki PNG/JPEG handlers register after upstream handlers so the
G26 allocation ledger stays active while fx-24 retains its other image formats.
The Ciuki handler uses the project's existing pinned libpng and stb JPEG sources.

--- a/netsurf/frontends/framebuffer/Makefile
+++ b/netsurf/frontends/framebuffer/Makefile
@@ -182,1 +182,2 @@
+S_FRONTEND += ciuki/download_store.c ciuki/raster.c ciuki/raster_content.c
 S_FRONTEND += ciuki/net.c ciuki/http.c ciuki/tls.c ciuki/dns.c
--- a/netsurf/content/handlers/image/image.c
+++ b/netsurf/content/handlers/image/image.c
@@ -47,0 +48 @@
+nserror ciuki_raster_init(void);
@@ -112 +113 @@
-	return error;
+	return ciuki_raster_init();
